@startuml
title DFD Level 0 - XWiki Adapter

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Consolas

actor "Пользователь\n(поиск/вопросы)" as User
actor "Администратор\n(ручной запуск индексации)" as Admin
rectangle "XWiki Adapter\nSpring Boot microservice" as Service
database "PostgreSQL + pgvector\npages / chunks / embeddings" as DB
cloud "XWiki REST API" as XWiki
cloud "Ollama / AI service\nembeddings + chat" as AI

User --> Service : HTTPS/HTTP\nGET /api/xwiki/search\nGET /api/xwiki/search/answer
Admin --> Service : HTTPS/HTTP\nGET /api/xwiki/processAll\nPOST /api/xwiki/processPage\nGET /api/chat\nGET /api/embedding
Service --> DB : JDBC / PostgreSQL 5432\nчтение/запись метаданных, чанков, векторов
Service --> XWiki : HTTPS/HTTP REST + Basic Auth\nполучение spaces/pages/content
Service --> AI : HTTP REST\nгенерация embeddings и chat completion

note bottom of Service
Trust boundaries:
1. Внешние клиенты -> микросервис
2. Микросервис -> внешние API
3. Микросервис -> база данных
end note

note left of User
Внешняя сеть
end note

note top of Service
Сервисная зона
end note

note bottom of DB
Зона данных
end note

note right of AI
Внешние интеграции
end note

@enduml
